      <p begin="00:12.940" end="00:14.620" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">It's going down (hey)</p>
      <p begin="00:14.620" end="00:18.120" ttm:agent="v1">Time is running boy, 그건 누구에겐 돈</p>
      <p begin="00:18.120" end="00:22.080" ttm:agent="v1">You know I'm so dope, 더는 못 기다려 줘</p>
