      <p begin="00:36.450" end="00:39.950" ttm:agent="v1">순간 반짝할 거면, 시작도 않는 걸</p>
      <p begin="00:39.950" end="00:43.300" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Sometimes, 내가 생각해도 (I think I'm really cool)</p>
